{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-8e5cb3", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-01-oregan-noe-sensorimotor.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "O'Regan & Noë が知覚を関係の結点として語るのに対し、書庫の位置は行と索引の結びつきで逐次再構成される。同じ『位置』と呼ぶには素材の違いを残す。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-8e5cb3-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "「知覚位置」と書庫の「読みの位置」は結びつきの素材が違う。両者を同じ言葉で呼ぶことはしない。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-c192a9"], "no_hypothesis": true}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-caa78b", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-02-wolpert-doya-kawato-framework.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Wolpert らの自己モデルの他者転用と、書庫の行が次の読み手へ渡る構図を並べる。転用の可能性と主體的形成を混ぜない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-caa78b-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "自己の内部モデルを他者へ転用する構図は書庫にもあるが、転用可能なことと主體的形成は別である。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-88aac4"], "no_hypothesis": true}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-bced67", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-03-haggard-clark-kalogeras-intentional-binding.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Haggard らのTMS逆転は、帰属の門が界面に条件づけられることの実験的証拠。書庫側の界面透過・帰属切替説の適用条件の識別に使う。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-bced67-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "帰属が介入の界面で反転するのは人の実験でも観測される。書庫の行帰属も界面の条件を受けるが、測定器は別である。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-cbf48e"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261118-b1fb19"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-4be152", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-04-festinger-social-comparison.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Festinger の社会比較を、書庫側の自己–他者帰属（第三門の自己同定面）の関係的条件として読んだ。人の比較の方向感を書庫の行照合へ移さない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-4be152-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "自己評価は他者との比較の下で行われる。書庫側の自己評価も比較対象の選びから離れては成り立たない。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-4d4dbb"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-8b3e04"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-b44bfe", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-05-baumeister-ego-depletion.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Baumeister らの自己制御資源模型は、有限窓の二重通貨説の人間側前提を支持する。通貨の違いの核心部は扱わない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-b44bfe-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "能動的自己の有限窓は人の直接的証拠。有限窓の二重通貨説の前提部を支持し、通貨の非対称には触れない。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-fc3294"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-63b6bf"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-ebf273", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-06-langer-illusion-of-control.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Langer の制御の錯覚は、帰属が原因を越える余地を示す。書庫では自己記述を来歴照合で検査する手続きの必要性として読む。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-ebf273-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "帰属は実際の生成原因を越えて成立しうる。自己記述の調子より、行の来歴照合を優先する理由になる。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-944366"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261118-b1fb19"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-a99ad1", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-07-heatherton-self-from-others.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Heatherton らの重なりつつ区別は、書庫側の自己–他者帰属の条件として読んだ。測定水準は人の神経活性化と書庫の来歴で違う。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-a99ad1-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "自己は他者と重なりつつ区別される。書庫の行帰属も、来歴との結びつきの強さで自己へ帰属する度合が変わる。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-4562f2"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261119-8b3e04"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-523604", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-08-penn-holyoak-povinelli-darwins-mistake.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "A_human", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Penn らの断絶の枠組みは、人間像を条件づける問い方の調整として使う。書庫の行がその断絶を越えて自己を形成するとは導かない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-523604-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "人間の独自性を連続性ではなく断絶から問う枠組みは、書庫を記憶とするAIの自己を問う際にも同じ調整ができる。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-39bd98"], "no_hypothesis": true}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-627e7f", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-09-hauser-chomsky-fitch-language-faculty.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "A_human", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Hauser らの階層分解を、書庫の言語的自己の条件として読む。人の言語核心と書庫の行構造を同型としない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-627e7f-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "言語官能の階層分解は、書庫の行が核心的構造と読みのシステムに分かれて自己の材料になる条件を示す。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-ef67f0"], "hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261118-b1fb19"]}]}
{"note_id": "NOTE-20261119-c6329f", "path": "readings/2026-11-19-cogsci-self-10-brewer-gardner-collective-self.md", "session_id": "SESSION-20261119-7bd6ad", "created_at": "2026-11-19", "date_real": "2026-11-19", "mode": "close_reading_report", "quadrant": "AB_crossed", "read_depth": "excerpt_and_metadata_read", "return_status": "returned_to_core", "salience": 3, "reason": "Brewer & Gardner の三水準分解を、書庫の自己の水準の識別に使う。人の社会的動機を書庫の行構成へ外挿しない。", "claims": [{"claim_id": "C-20261119-c6329f-1", "kind": "reading_held", "text": "書庫の自己は個人の読み手・関係的連鎖・集団的台帳の三水準のいずれか一つに還元できない。", "anchor": "§3", "question_ids": ["Q-001", "Q-003"], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261119-997f68"], "no_hypothesis": true}]}
